OL,3,CSimon Levy found guilty of murdering
OL,4,Ctwo women and raping a third
OL,6,FSimon Levy has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmurdering two women and sexually
OL,8,Fassaulting a third, who escaped the
OL,9,Fviolent attack with a broken
OL,10,Fcollarbone.
OL,12,FLevy, 40, was found guilty of
OL,13,Fmurdering Carmenza Valencia-Trujillo,
OL,14,F53, in March last year, and Sheryl
OL,15,FWilkins, 39, in August last year.
OL,17,FHe killed both of the vulnerable women
OL,18,Fin the middle of sexual encounters in
OL,19,Fsecluded areas of London.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
