OL,3,CSimon Levy found guilty of murdering
OL,4,Ctwo women and raping a third
OL,6,FMs Valencia-Trujillo was found in the
OL,7,Fstairwell of Wendover House, a block
OL,8,Fof flats in Southwark, south-east
OL,9,FLondon, on March 17 last year.
OL,11,FMs Wilkins was found dead four months
OL,12,Flater in a car park in Tottenham on
OL,13,FAugust 24.
OL,15,FLevy was also found guilty of carrying
OL,16,Fout a violent sex attack against a
OL,17,Fthird woman in the same Tottenham car
OL,18,Fpark in January last year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
