OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786141096
OL,3,CSimon Levy found guilty of murdering
OL,4,Ctwo women and raping a third
OL,6,FThe victim, who cannot be named for
OL,7,Flegal reasons, survived the attack but
OL,8,Fsuffered a broken collarbone.
OL,10,FIn a majority verdict, the jury found
OL,11,Fhim guilty of all six counts he faced.
OL,13,FJurors heard Levy has previous
OL,14,Fconvictions for sexual assaults on
OL,15,Fwomen, six of which happened in the
OL,16,Fsame time period.
OL,18,FLevy, from Tottenham, declined to give
OL,19,Fevidence in his defence but pleaded
OL,20,Fnot guilty to the two women's murders.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
