OL,3,CSimon Levy found guilty of murdering
OL,4,Ctwo women and raping a third
OL,6,FHe further denied two charges of rape,
OL,7,Fgrievous bodily harm with intent, and
OL,8,Fnon-fatal suffocation against the
OL,9,Fsurviving woman.
OL,11,FDuring the trial, prosecutors alleged
OL,12,FLevy lived in "a world of sex
OL,13,Foffending, a world of rape,
OL,14,Fstrangulation, suffocation, violence
OL,15,Fand also dishonesty".
OL,17,FJurors were shown a document entitled
OL,18,F"sex" was located on Levy's computer
OL,19,Fcontaining a web address which
OL,20,Fincluded "search" and "gang raped" in
OL,21,Fits URL.
