OL,3,CSimon Levy found guilty of murdering
OL,4,Ctwo women and raping a third
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThe website linked to a pornographic
OL,12,Fwebsite that featured "rape" in its
OL,13,Ftitle.
OL,15,FThe court was told there was no record
OL,16,Fof Levy accessing the website using
OL,17,Fthe computer or any of the devices
OL,18,Fseized from him.
