OL,3,CSimon Levy found guilty of murdering
OL,4,Ctwo women and raping a third
OL,6,FOther folders relating to sports
OL,7,Fincluding mixed martial arts and
OL,8,Ftennis were also found on his computer.
OL,10,FProsecutor Tom Little KC said a
OL,11,Fdocument found on Levy's computer
OL,12,Fentitled "my sex record" revealed his
OL,13,F"attitude to women".
OL,15,FLittle also said Levy's decision not
OL,16,Fto give evidence in the case was
OL,17,F"proof positive that he is trying to
OL,18,Fhide the truth from you, his silence
OL,19,Fin this case is deafening".
